      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتثّت الخَيْلُ</span></b>  (as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتفّت</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اغتبّت</span>, O)
<i>The horses found,</i> or <i>lighted upon, somewhat of the</i>
[<i>herbage called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبِيع</span>, (O, K, TA,) <i>and became
fat in consequence thereof after having been lean.</i>
(TA.)

